# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads as the build context for the decode server (MVP W9).
#
# ⚠ THE REASON THIS FILE EXISTS: without it, gcloud derives the upload list from `.gitignore` — and
# `apps/web/public/models/` is gitignored (the weights are too big for GitHub). The build would then
# arrive without the three ONNX graphs and fail at `prepare-models.mjs`, or worse, produce an image
# with no model in it. Naming the exclusions here explicitly keeps the weights IN.
#
# Everything the Dockerfile does not COPY is excluded, because `data/` alone is tens of gigabytes.

.git/
.gitignore
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Training and research material — none of it ships (CLAUDE.md: Python is training/data only).
data/
.venv-ml/
src/
scripts/
docs/
tools/
archive/

# Build outputs and local state.
dist/
**/dist/
apps/server/models/
*.log

# The gate's 14 test strips live beside the graphs; `prepare-models.mjs` reads gate.json for the
# token map and drops the fixture, so the images themselves never need to travel.
apps/web/public/models/*.png
apps/web/public/models/*.pixels.bin
